  "description": "I am heading to Wakefield Manor, a place filled with memories of my childhood and the home of my friends. Heraes Vernon, the eldest son of the Vernon family, sets out for Wakefield Manor, where his dear old friend William Harkley lives, to attend the memorial service for the Earl of Carlisle in place of his ailing father. William Harkley and his older brother, Andrew Harkley. Though he had spent his childhood with them as if they were brothers, his excitement at reuniting with them after so long is short-lived. On what should have been a solemn night of remembrance, Heres witnesses William and his brother engaging in a physical act. As they remain stranded at the manor due to a storm, suspicious events gradually begin to unfold...\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
